---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHeader from "../../components/PageHeader.astro";
import Callout from "../../components/Callout.astro";
import { activeStates, hybridStates } from "../../data/states";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="State-by-State Guides"
  description="Compare every U.S. state that lets you become a lawyer through apprenticeship: California, Vermont, Virginia, Washington, plus hybrid programs in Maine and New York."
>
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="State Guides"
    title="Where you can legally read the law"
    subtitle="Four states let you skip law school entirely. Two more allow a hybrid combination. Here's how each one actually works."
  />

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-16">
    <Callout tone="warning" title="Rules change — verify before you rely on this">
      We've researched every rule on this page directly from each state's governing authority, but bar
      admission rules are amended over time and our summaries can fall out of date. Before you make any
      decision, confirm current requirements directly with the official body listed for each state.
    </Callout>

    <h2 class="mt-4 font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-navy">Active, pure apprenticeship states</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-ink-light">
      In these four states, you can become fully eligible to sit the bar exam through law office study
      alone — zero law school required.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-navy/10">
      <table class="w-full min-w-[720px] border-collapse bg-white text-left text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="bg-navy text-parchment">
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-serif font-semibold">State</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-serif font-semibold">Program</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-serif font-semibold">Duration</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-serif font-semibold">Supervisor requirement</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-3 font-serif font-semibold">Interim exam?</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {
            activeStates.map((s, i) => (
              <tr class={i % 2 === 0 ? "bg-white" : "bg-parchment-dark/30"}>
                <td class="px-4 py-4 align-top font-semibold text-navy">
                  <a href={`/states/${s.slug}/`} class="hover:text-brass">{s.name}</a>
                </td>
                <td class="px-4 py-4 align-top text-ink-light">{s.programName}</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-4 align-top text-ink-light">{s.duration}</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-4 align-top text-ink-light">{s.supervisorShort}</td>
                <td class="px-4 py-4 align-top text-ink-light">{s.milestoneExam ?? "No"}</td>
              </tr>
            ))
          }
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {
        activeStates.map((s) => (
          <a href={`/states/${s.slug}/`} class="group rounded-lg border border-navy/10 bg-white p-6 transition hover:border-brass hover:shadow-md">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-navy group-hover:text-brass">{s.name} — {s.programName}</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-light">{s.summary}</p>
            <span class="mt-3 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-brass group-hover:text-navy">Full details →</span>
          </a>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <h2 class="mt-16 font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-navy">Hybrid combination states</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-ink-light">
      Maine and New York don't let you skip law school entirely, but both allow you to combine a reduced
      period of ABA-accredited law school with a period of law office study — useful if you want to cut
      tuition costs without giving up law school credentials entirely.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {
        hybridStates.map((s) => (
          <a href={`/states/${s.slug}/`} class="group rounded-lg border border-navy/10 bg-white p-6 transition hover:border-brass hover:shadow-md">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-navy group-hover:text-brass">{s.name} — {s.programName}</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-light">{s.summary}</p>
            <span class="mt-3 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-brass group-hover:text-navy">Full details →</span>
          </a>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <Callout tone="info" title="What about other states?">
      A few other states — Wyoming among them — historically ran their own law reader programs but have
      since discontinued them. Rules do occasionally change in the other direction too, so if your home
      state isn't listed here, it's still worth checking directly with its bar admissions authority rather
      than assuming the door is permanently closed.
    </Callout>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
